{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Build a Civilization Through the Ages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is a historical strategy and city-building simulator where you guide your settlement from the Stone Age through key stages of human development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, grow your economy, provide for your people, and watch the world change alongside your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Placement Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building in <strong>Agecraft</strong> needs the right location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distance to resources, warehouses, and production chains directly affects logistics efficiency and settlement growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 Step-by-Step Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction isn\u2019t magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units physically deliver resources, and structures are built in stages \u2014 only becoming functional once fully completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc77 A Living World of Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don\u2019t stand still: they carry materials, work, eat, and respond to environmental changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action has a physical presence, making the world feel truly <strong>alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc17 Hunting and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is not just beautiful \u2014 it\u2019s a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early ages, hunting wild animals is essential for survival. But creatures like bears can become real threats to your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Gameplay progression through historical ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Physical logistics: storage, transportation, resource accessibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Step-by-step construction with visible progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Living population with basic needs and behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Natural environment: hunting, danger, survival balance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddea Development Status</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is an indie project currently in active development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far, the following has been implemented:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One historical age (Stone Age)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core mechanics: building, logistics, labor, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world of units with basic simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded What\u2019s Next</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional ages with unique buildings, resources, transport, and technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New systems: social needs, diplomacy, smarter AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved performance, UI, and visual fidelity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Support the Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is crafted with love for strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist, follow development updates, and join the community helping shape the game from day one.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2722940?t=1764385686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/9e3d72a0ed78b34fde872ff9304ace6d42078dde/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764385686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/4e0296e720397ffc09662ff12a75988bebc4c6be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764385686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/4e0296e720397ffc09662ff12a75988bebc4c6be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764385686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3938000,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfdb\ufe0f Build a Civilization Through the Ages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is a historical strategy and city-building simulator where you guide your settlement from the Stone Age through key stages of human development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place buildings, grow your economy, provide for your people, and watch the world change alongside your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Placement Matters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building in <strong>Agecraft</strong> needs the right location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distance to resources, warehouses, and production chains directly affects logistics efficiency and settlement growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/5d2a9f9c78b8c4f99ce8d149d6167cd2.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd28 Step-by-Step Construction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construction isn\u2019t magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Units physically deliver resources, and structures are built in stages \u2014 only becoming functional once fully completed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14824cd1aeccb7aad77aedad9fcf2675.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc77 A Living World of Units</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >People don\u2019t stand still: they carry materials, work, eat, and respond to environmental changes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every action has a physical presence, making the world feel truly <strong>alive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/64cbdf4de194694e80d38beb6a0240db.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc17 Hunting and Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nature is not just beautiful \u2014 it\u2019s a challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the early ages, hunting wild animals is essential for survival. But creatures like bears can become real threats to your people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.poster.avif?t=1764385686\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.webm?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/extras/14f8a6a392fdb6fb38e23817d2aa69ab.mp4?t=1764385686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2699\ufe0f Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Gameplay progression through historical ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Physical logistics: storage, transportation, resource accessibility</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Step-by-step construction with visible progress</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Living population with basic needs and behavior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Natural environment: hunting, danger, survival balance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\uddea Development Status</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is an indie project currently in active development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So far, the following has been implemented:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One historical age (Stone Age)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core mechanics: building, logistics, labor, and survival</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A living world of units with basic simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udded What\u2019s Next</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional ages with unique buildings, resources, transport, and technologies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New systems: social needs, diplomacy, smarter AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved performance, UI, and visual fidelity</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\udcac Support the Project</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agecraft</strong> is crafted with love for strategy games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist, follow development updates, and join the community helping shape the game from day one.</p>","developers":["SnakyDevelop"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722940/7fee8da34590c8075132c7d2057336fa13a62dce/header.jpg?t=1764385686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2722940/678805345/5ead0aae404197a5bc20d62dece620f0fb44acb2/1754236552/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764193656","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2722940/678805345/5ead0aae404197a5bc20d62dece620f0fb44acb2/1754236552/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764193656","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2722940/678805345/5ead0aae404197a5bc20d62dece620f0fb44acb2/1754236552/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764193656","id":257177596,"name":"Announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257177596/fb2f2e81c80c4720e639984db705d3a6773757f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764193656"}],"name":"Agecraft","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows\u00ae 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel\u00ae Core\u2122 i5-4670 (quad-core) / AMD\u00ae FX-Series\u2122 FX-4350 (quad-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA\u00ae GeForce\u00ae GTX 1050 (2 GB) / AMD\u00ae Radeon\u2122 RX-460 (4 GB) / Intel\u00ae Arc\u2122 A380 (6 GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br