ke care of your people, and guide your civilization through the ages, from the Stone Age to the future.","steam_appid":2722940,"support_info":{"email":"dp.games.net@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Ukrainian","type":"game","website":null}